                  <a href="https://github.com/flutter/plugins/pull/2992">2992</a> Standardize LICENSE body text formatting (cla: yes)
                </p>
                <p>
                  <a href="https://github.com/flutter/plugins/pull/2993">2993</a> Add LUCI try builders json config file (cla: yes)
                </p>
                <p>
                  <a href="https://github.com/flutter/plugins/pull/3006">3006</a> [device_info_platform_interface] Typo in doc fixed (cla: yes)
                </p>
                <p>
                  <a href="https://github.com/flutter/plugins/pull/3007">3007</a> [image_picker_for_web] Can't select some video file types (3gp, mp4, possibly others...) (cla: yes)
                </p>
                <p>
                  <a href="https://github.com/flutter/plugins/pull/3008">3008</a> [url_launcher] Suppress deprecation warning in WebViewActivity (cla: yes)
                </p>
                <p>
                  <a href="https://github.com/flutter/plugins/pull/3010">3010</a> [url_launcher_web] Fix a typo in a test name and fix quote consistency (cla: yes, waiting for test harness)
                </p>
                <p>
                  <a href="https://github.com/flutter/plugins/pull/3011">3011</a> [google_maps_flutter] Fix typo in google_maps_flutter/example/map_ui.dart (cla: yes)
                </p>
